  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "+b42m6HZZ6uB0AeFSuQuF6BkvgA=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:48:45.459Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Two methods move a document between versions, and their **ordering of checks** is the part worth memorising because it decides which error you get.\n\n`computeUpgradePath(documentType, fromVersion, toVersion): UpgradeTransition[]` walks the keys `v(from+1)..v(to)`:\n\n- `from === to` \u2192 returns `[]` **and skips the manifest lookup**, so it does not throw even when no manifest is registered;\n- `to < from` \u2192 throws `DowngradeNotSupportedError` **before** the manifest lookup;\n- no manifest for the type \u2192 `ManifestNotFoundError`;\n- a missing step inside the range \u2192 `MissingUpgradeTransitionError`.\n\n`getUpgradeReducer(documentType, fromVersion, toVersion)` returns the reducer for a **single** step, so `toVersion` must equal `fromVersion + 1`. The single-step check **runs before the manifest lookup**, which is why `getUpgradeReducer(\"test/todo\", 1, 3)` throws `InvalidUpgradeStepError` even with no v3 manifest registered.\n\nWorked, with `supportedVersions = [1, 2]`:\n\n```ts\nregistry.computeUpgradePath(\"test/todo\", 1, 2); // [v2 transition]\nregistry.computeUpgradePath(\"test/todo\", 2, 2); // [] \u2014 no manifest needed\nregistry.getUpgradeReducer(\"test/todo\", 1, 2);  // the v1 -> v2 reducer\nregistry.computeUpgradePath(\"test/todo\", 2, 1); // DowngradeNotSupportedError\nregistry.getUpgradeReducer(\"test/todo\", 1, 3);  // InvalidUpgradeStepError\n```\n\nAlso on the API: `registerUpgradeManifests` never throws and returns one result per input (a falsy `documentType` or an already-registered type yields `DuplicateManifestError`); `unregisterUpgradeManifests(...types)` returns `true` **only if every** type had a manifest, while still removing those that exist; `getUpgradeManifest` throws `ManifestNotFoundError`.\n\n## Provenance\n- `apps/academy/docs/academy/04-Reference/01-Reactor/06-DocumentModelRegistry.md` \u2014 Upgrade API (registerUpgradeManifests, unregisterUpgradeManifests, getUpgradeManifest, computeUpgradePath, getUpgradeReducer); Upgrade path example\n\n_Extracted from the Powerhouse repository at **v6.2.2-dev.74**._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-03T07:48:45.459Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:48:45.459Z"
    }
  },
